<title>CANADA: Sun Life Assurance to form securities unit.</title>
<headline>Sun Life Assurance to form securities unit.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sun Life Assurance Co of Canada said that it received regulatory approval to form a securities unit to offer equities, fixed income and mutual funds, which it plans to start on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Sun Life Securities (Inc) will initially operate only in Ontario but intends to later expand to other provinces,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>&quot;The company, which will initially employ four traders, will not offer commodity and financial futures or generic derivatives,&quot; it said. Toronto-based Sun Life provides insurance and financial products.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
